{"content_html": "<html><body><div> <p>Dưới đây là gợi ý lời giải chi tiết của đề thi Toán, mã đề 103 của kỳ thi tốt nghiệp trung học phổ thông năm 2026. Lời giải do các giáo viên nhóm Toán tiểu học-trung học cơ sở-trung học phổ thông Việt Nam thực hiện, thí sinh dùng để tham khảo.</p>\n<figure> <img alt=\"z7926205926215-d52caccea8b56d78a66d187d22d624c0.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.nhandan.vn/images/bd3f59fafa396d46198f878b9d7e3d6ac5969b8f0a0c7385f92f527a958f9b673a6f4c0ffa66560c3d8de8031068bc417e2b645af6892047b54eb5c0f2cd4bd05719f70cb8a2672c5d8589a8a71f39f8/z7926205926215-d52caccea8b56d78a66d187d22d624c0.jpg.avif\"/>\n</figure>\n<p>​</p>\n<figure> <img alt=\"z7926206137832-58137c6f61a5e465b5328ff6b368adf1.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.nhandan.vn/images/bd3f59fafa396d46198f878b9d7e3d6a533044c28747dab830b91c183a84cf02b24f7c41fddc73f6babfe7b7c58837fe6487c3db4207cadf8416dedc9a98e30765e244cdb09d7ed7950f6abc6caf9763/z7926206137832-58137c6f61a5e465b5328ff6b368adf1.jpg.avif\"/>\n</figure>\n<figure> <img alt=\"z7926206664298-e99e79933ff32a39570ce3b689b9efd5.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.nhandan.vn/images/bd3f59fafa396d46198f878b9d7e3d6ac8479716c67ca2a5403e70e5aa3f1614f332064fb7d8586ae7bd1e9fa1f674dc06b93bee95604c3e1cba482e55b8b445ebc2f80c0ff81e5673bf764d07ce893b/z7926206664298-e99e79933ff32a39570ce3b689b9efd5.jpg.avif\"/>\n</figure>\n\n<figure> <img alt=\"z7926206887273-fcb93d03f47acec595ff7124163afcd0.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.nhandan.vn/images/bd3f59fafa396d46198f878b9d7e3d6aa7072e453eea984d3585b50ee1489af9ebc92571ddf30b4960a26f409a4973f573c5c6ac1dc4754a0cf126a2b895b80d0fea61bf76d37af14fed44b885223ecf/z7926206887273-fcb93d03f47acec595ff7124163afcd0.jpg.avif\"/>\n</figure>\n<figure> <img alt=\"z7926207203794-2f94432995b5432c437022351a1d4d3e.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.nhandan.vn/images/bd3f59fafa396d46198f878b9d7e3d6a30e8b817b8bc0ac6c42aa85e692db75a394ec20a4452e471554b32afe452f6f982cf24862939dc10f38588052f00ea64cc33dd0ec2d795de5c5891e4f7bd3928/z7926207203794-2f94432995b5432c437022351a1d4d3e.jpg.a